Usage example (not a file to create, just how you'd wire it up):

```tsx
<CheckoutPage
  items={cartItems}
  onBackToCart={() => navigate("/cart")}
  onPay={(address) => submitOrder(cartItems, address)}
/>
```

Notes on the design choices: required-field validation fires on blur and on submit, Pay is disabled while the cart is empty or a payment is in flight, and shipping becomes free automatically once the subtotal clears $50 — adjust `FREE_SHIPPING_THRESHOLD`/`FLAT_SHIPPING_FEE` as needed. Swap `formatCurrency`'s hardcoded `"USD"` if you need multi-currency support.
